docs {
  # Admin Get Card Settings

  Admin uses this endpoint to see the current virtual dollar card settings before editing them.

  ## Endpoint

  `GET /api/v1/admin/cards/settings`

  ## Authentication

  Admin JWT required:

  ```txt
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
  ```

  The logged-in user must have:

  ```json
  {
    "role": "admin"
  }
  ```

  ## Important Card Creation Fee Rule

  Maplerad does not currently provide a separate endpoint for card creation fee.

  Because of that, BillXpress stores the fee in admin card settings:

  `creationFeeUsd.flat`
  The BillXpress card creation fee charged to the customer, in USD.

  `providerCreationFee.flat`
  The provider/Maplerad card creation cost we want to include in pricing, in USD.

  During card creation quote, the backend converts these USD fees to NGN using
  a fresh Maplerad USD-to-NGN quote. Card creation itself does not fund the card
  automatically; funding fees and funding limits apply only to the separate card
  funding endpoints.

  ## Expected Success Response

  ```json
  {
    "settings": {
      "isEnabled": true,
      "allowedBrands": ["VISA", "MASTERCARD"],
      "defaultBrand": "VISA",
      "creationFee": {
        "percent": 0,
        "flat": 0,
        "currency": "NGN",
        "deprecated": true
      },
      "creationFeeUsd": {
        "percent": 0,
        "flat": 3,
        "currency": "USD"
      },
      "providerCreationFee": {
        "percent": 0,
        "flat": 2
      },
      "fundingFee": {
        "percent": 0,
        "flat": 0,
        "thresholdAmount": 100000,
        "belowThresholdFlat": 2000,
        "aboveThresholdPercent": 3
      },
      "withdrawalFee": {
        "percent": 0,
        "flat": 2000,
        "thresholdAmount": 0,
        "belowThresholdFlat": 0,
        "aboveThresholdPercent": 0
      },
      "crossBorderFee": {
        "percent": 0,
        "flat": 0,
        "thresholdAmount": 0,
        "belowThresholdFlat": 0,
        "aboveThresholdPercent": 0
      },
      "chargebackFee": {
        "percent": 0,
        "flat": 0,
        "thresholdAmount": 0,
        "belowThresholdFlat": 0,
        "aboveThresholdPercent": 0
      },
      "declineFee": {
        "percent": 0,
        "flat": 0,
        "thresholdAmount": 0,
        "belowThresholdFlat": 0,
        "aboveThresholdPercent": 0
      },
      "fundingExchangeMarkupPercent": 0,
      "withdrawalExchangeMarkupPercent": 0,
      "monthlyMaintenanceFee": 0,
      "maintenanceGracePeriodDays": 3,
      "freezeOnMaintenanceFailure": true,
      "minimumFundingAmount": 1000,
      "maximumFundingAmount": 1000000,
      "minimumWithdrawalAmount": 1,
      "quoteTtlSeconds": 300,
      "updatedBy": "66...",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-07T13:43:25.545Z"
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Admin Dashboard Notes

  Show `creationFeeUsd.flat` as "BillXpress card creation fee (USD)".

  Show `providerCreationFee.flat` as "Provider card creation cost (USD)".

  Do not use the deprecated `creationFee` field for new card creation pricing.
  It is kept only for old compatibility and is not used by new card creation
  quotes.

  `minimumFundingAmount`, `maximumFundingAmount`, and `fundingFee` do not
  affect card creation anymore. They apply when the user funds an
  already-created card.

  Every fee object uses the same editable shape:

  ```json
  {
    "percent": 0,
    "flat": 0,
    "thresholdAmount": 0,
    "belowThresholdFlat": 0,
    "aboveThresholdPercent": 0
  }
  ```

  `thresholdAmount`, `belowThresholdFlat`, and `aboveThresholdPercent` are used
  for tiered customer fees such as card funding: charge `NGN 2,000` below
  `NGN 100,000`, otherwise charge a percentage. Set `thresholdAmount` to `0`
  for normal percent-plus-flat fees.

  For card funding, the frontend admin page should only expose our customer
  billing rule from `fundingFee`:

  - below `NGN 100,000`: charge `NGN 2,000`
  - from `NGN 100,000` upward: charge `3%` of the amount the user entered

  Example:

  ```json
  {
    "fundingFee": {
      "percent": 0,
      "flat": 0,
      "thresholdAmount": 100000,
      "belowThresholdFlat": 2000,
      "aboveThresholdPercent": 3
    }
  }
  ```

  Withdrawal is also our customer charge only. If it is fixed, send
  `withdrawalFee.percent` as `0` and put the fixed NGN amount in
  `withdrawalFee.flat`.

  The extra incident/cross-border fields are admin-editable customer charge
  controls: `crossBorderFee`, `chargebackFee`, and `declineFee`. Do not show
  Maplerad/provider inputs for these charges on the admin form.

  After saving changes with `PATCH /api/v1/admin/cards/settings`, re-fetch this endpoint or use the returned `settings` object.
}
